.x release lines"},"2841":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-17","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","type":"heading","tags":["multi-page"],"url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#hadoop-version-support-matrix-for-eom-pre-10-release-lines","content":"Hadoop version support matrix for EOM pre-1.0 release lines"},"2842":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-18","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","type":"heading","tags":["multi-page"],"url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#hadoop-3-support-for-the-hbase-binary-releases-and-maven-artifacts","content":"Hadoop 3 Support for the HBase Binary Releases and Maven Artifacts"},"2843":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-19","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","type":"heading","tags":["multi-page"],"url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#hadoop-3-version-policy","content":"Hadoop 3 version policy"},"2844":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-20","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","type":"heading","tags":["multi-page"],"url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#dfsdatanodemaxtransferthreads","content":"`dfs.datanode.max.transfer.threads`"},"2845":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-21","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","type":"heading","tags":["multi-page"],"url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#zookeeper-requirements","content":"ZooKeeper Requirements"},"2846":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-22","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","tags":["multi-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#configuration-basic-prerequisites-java","content":"HBase runs on the Java Virtual Machine, thus all HBase deployments require a JVM runtime."},"2847":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-23","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","tags":["multi-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#configuration-basic-prerequisites-java","content":"The following table summarizes the HBase community's recommendations for Java versions:"},"2848":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-24","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","tags":["multi-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#configuration-basic-prerequisites-java","content":"✅ indicates a recommended deployment combination with a base level of testing. The community is willing to help diagnose and address issues."},"2849":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-25","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","tags":["multi-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#configuration-basic-prerequisites-java","content":"⚠️ indicates possible compatibility challenges. Review the available guidance before choosing this combination."},"2850":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-26","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","tags":["multi-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#configuration-basic-prerequisites-java","content":"❌ indicates an unsupported combination. The Java version is deprecated by the HBase community, or the combination is known not to work."},"2851":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-27","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","tags":["multi-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#configuration-basic-prerequisites-java","content":"Treat any combination not listed in the table as ❌."},"2852":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-28","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","tags":["multi-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#configuration-basic-prerequisites-java","content":"Newer JDKs may have compatibility issues with older HBase releases that cannot be fixed within HBase's compatibility guarantees."},"2853":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-29","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","tags":["multi-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#configuration-basic-prerequisites-java","content":"Check the table notes for limitations, including build failures, test failures, and operational issues."},"2854":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-30","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","tags":["multi-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#configuration-basic-prerequisites-java","content":"HBase recommends downstream users rely only on JDK releases that are marked as Long-Term Supported\n(LTS), either from the OpenJDK project or vendors. At the time of this writing, the following JDK\nreleases are NOT LTS releases and are NOT tested or advocated for use by the Apache HBase\ncommunity: JDK9, JDK10, JDK12, JDK13, and JDK14. Community discussion around this decision is\nrecorded on HBASE-20264."},"2855":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-31","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","tags":["multi-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#configuration-basic-prerequisites-java","content":"At this time, all testing performed by the Apache HBase project runs on the HotSpot variant of the\nJVM. When selecting your JDK distribution, please take this into consideration."},"2856":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-32","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","tags":["multi-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#java-support-by-release-line","content":"HBase Version"},"2857":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-33","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","tags":["multi-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites#java-support-by-release-line","content":"JDK 6"},"2858":{"id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites-34","page_id":"/docs/configuration/basic-prerequisites","tags":["multi