s":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#changing-the-refresh-delay","content":"You can change the refresh by pressing `d` key in the top screen."},"18029":{"id":"/docs/single-page-8229","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#changing-the-displayed-fields","content":"You can move to the field screen by pressing `f` key in the top screen. In the fields screen, you can change the displayed fields by choosing a field and pressing `d` key or `space` key."},"18030":{"id":"/docs/single-page-8230","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#changing-the-sort-field","content":"You can move to the fields screen by pressing `f` key in the top screen. In the field screen, you can change the sort field by choosing a field and pressing `s`. Also, you can change the sort order (ascending or descending) by pressing `R` key."},"18031":{"id":"/docs/single-page-8231","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#changing-the-order-of-the-fields","content":"You can move to the fields screen by pressing `f` key in the top screen. In the field screen, you can change the order of the fields."},"18032":{"id":"/docs/single-page-8232","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#filters","content":"You can filter the metric records with the filter feature. We can add filters by pressing `o` key for ignoring case or `O` key for case sensitive."},"18033":{"id":"/docs/single-page-8233","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#filters","content":"The syntax is as follows:"},"18034":{"id":"/docs/single-page-8234","page_id":"/docs/single-page","tags":["single-page"],"type":"text","url":"/docs/single-page#filters","content":"For example, we can add filters like the following:"},"18035":{"id":"/docs/single-page-8235","page_id":"/docs/single-