efix Tree"],[2574,"Prefix tree encoding was introduced as an experimental feature in HBase 0.96.\nIt provides similar memory savings to the Prefix, Diff, and Fast Diff encoder, but provides faster random access at a cost of slower encoding speed.\nIt was removed in hbase-2.0.0. It was a good idea but little uptake. If interested in reviving this effort, write the hbase dev list."],[18472,"Prefix tree encoding was introduced as an experimental feature in HBase 0.96.\nIt provides similar memory savings to the Prefix, Diff, and Fast Diff encoder, but provides faster random access at a cost of slower encoding speed.\nIt was removed in hbase-2.0.0. It was a good idea but little uptake. If interested in reviving this effort, write the hbase dev list."],[2947,"Preliminary support for JDK 11 was introduced with HBase 2.3.0, and for JDK 17 with HBase 2.5.x. JDK 11 and JDK 17 have precommit and nightly coverage on applicable branches. We mark support as ✅ after running some integration tests with that JDK version and confirming that community members use it in production clusters."],[11984,"Preliminary support for JDK 11 was introduced with HBase 2.3.0, and for JDK 17 with HBase 2.5.x. JDK 11 and JDK 17 have precommit and nightly coverage on applicable branches. We mark support as ✅ after running some integration tests with that JDK version and confirming that community members use it in production clusters."],[8736,"Prepare the Data:"],[15487,"Prepare the Data:"],[171,"prepareBulkLoad"],[18380,"prepareBulkLoad"],[288,"Preparing data via a MapReduce job"],[10675,"Preparing data via a MapReduce job"],[6140,"Prerequisites"],[6142,"Prerequisites"],[6144,"Prerequisites"],[7471,"Prerequisites"],[8159,"Prerequisites"],[8517,"Prerequisites"],[10439,"Prerequisites"],[10451,"Prerequisites"],[10993,"Prerequisites"],[11271,"Prerequisites"],[11273,"Prerequisites"],[11275,"Prerequisites"],[2108,"Presuming you have run basic tests, the rat check, passes and all is\nlooking good, now is the